    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mate in Eleven (#M11)</strong>\u00a0is Yet Another entry in the auto-battler format.<br><br>M11 offers a unique twist of engine-based &quot;<strong>Perfect Combat</strong>&quot; to the auto-battler, which takes combat RNG out of the equation.<br><br>Your positioning and your read on your opponent and their strategy is all that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With reduced shop RNG as well, this game captures the &quot;perfect knowledge&quot; aspect of chess in the auto-battler format, while also allowing for players to think tactically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows for the perfect competitive auto-battler, where your micro-adjustments, positioning, and economical decisions decide exactly where you will place every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom lobbies (up to 8 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots for custom lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with engine lines for every position</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom ELO system to measure yourself against other tacticians</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mate in Eleven (#M11)</strong>\u00a0is Yet Another entry in the auto-battler format.<br><br>M11 offers a unique twist of engine-based &quot;<strong>Perfect Combat</strong>&quot; to the auto-battler, which takes combat RNG out of the equation.<br><br>Your positioning and your read on your opponent and their strategy is all that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With reduced shop RNG as well, this game captures the &quot;perfect knowledge&quot; aspect of chess in the auto-battler format, while also allowing for players to think tactically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows for the perfect competitive auto-battler, where your micro-adjustments, positioning, and economical decisions decide exactly where you will place every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom lobbies (up to 8 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots for custom lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with engine lines for every position</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom ELO system to measure yourself against other tacticians</p></li></ul>",
